        "ref": "NUM 21:28",
        "textualBasisJa": "for a fire has gone out of Heshbon, a flame from the city of Sihon. It has devoured Ar of Moab, The lords of the high places of the Arnon."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 22:36",
        "textualBasisJa": "When Balak heard that Balaam had come, he went out to meet him to the City of Moab, which is on the border of the Arnon, which is in the utmost part of the border."
      }
